  "Powered by HiTechPay"; symbol id kept for compatibility
- replace user-visible "Hyperswitch" in locale strings (poweredBy, mandate
  texts) and the default payout collector name with "HiTechPay"
- the Australian BECS mandate (names a legal entity), JS globals
  (window.Hyper, HyperLoader.js), postMessage events, CSS classes and the
  "hyperswitch" vault type are intentionally unchanged; English stays the
  default locale fallback

